                        of International Security Affairs, Department of Defense until August 1952;
                        detailed to National War College, August 1952–June 1953.

Robertson, General Sir Brian H., Commander
                        in Chief, British Middle East Land Forces until retirement, November 1953;
                        Chairman, British Transport Commission from 1953.

Salisbury, Lord Robert A.J.G., British
                        Lord President to the Privy Council from 1952; Leader of the House of Lords;
